{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/968741-unexpected-beast-inspiration-persona-5","id":968741,"title":"Unexpected Beast Inspiration: Persona 5","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-13T14:30:16-07:00","id":968741,"title":"Unexpected Beast Inspiration: Persona 5","content":"So Persona 5 is finally out in Japan, and a glance at some of the early spoilers confirms something I've been thinking since it was revealed: it's totally a Beast game! (If you want to go into it blind when it hits the states, look away now!)<br /> <br /> The basic premise is that the player characters are a group of high school students who discover their Personas, creatures made up of their inner thoughts and desires who draw their forms from mythology and fiction, and use their newfound powers to hunt down criminals, abusers, and other loathsome people by entering their subconscious minds and 'stealing' the cruelty out of their hearts. The Persona series has always leaned on some interesting psychology, but the newest entry focusing so much on trying to redeem and reform terrible folks by entering their minds/souls and teaching them Lessons... I can't be the only one seeing this, can I?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T15:02:49-07:00","id":968761,"title":"","content":"I had the same idea a while ago. <br /> <br /> You could do it with Mage too, but it would only work well if everyone was a Mastigos, and Persona are a pretty good fit for the Devouring, so Beast works much better. You've even got the Hive and everything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T15:17:05-07:00","id":968774,"title":"","content":"...damn it, I've been trying to fit Persona into ChroD for years and I never even thought of that (beyond just Geist being confirmed as inspired by Persona 3), but it's perfect. <br /> <br /> No one ask me about my overly detailed idea for a Demon game based on Persona though unless you want to lose an hour hearing about something that'll never exist","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T19:42:29-07:00","id":970419,"title":"","content":"The fact that the Persona 5 team comes from a delinquent school and masquerade as master thieves gives them more ambiguous morals than the past Persona users, the criminality tying into the villainy of Beast quite nicely.<br /> <br /> I'm also glad to see the dungeons of Persona 5 (heists into people's hearts and minds) expanding from the Shadow created dungeons of the Midnight Channel in Persona 4, a similar concept. Beasts having this connection to the primordial pathways into dreams/the collected unconscious is one of my favorite things about the game.<br /> <br /> <br /> Whether it's me being a glutton for punishment or curiosity, I'd listen to that spiel on a Persona infused Demon, Gecko. Although that's better served for a new topic or PM. It's too early for myself to say but I've started contributing to a fan game project that includes a lot of the Persona concepts pertaining to Self and Shadow. Actually, if you wanted to build the Persona tabletop game that uses the storytelling system it would be cribbed from 4 to 5 different venues from OP and fan projects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12284-metablender","name":"-metablender","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12284_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T15:58:00-07:00","id":971554,"title":"","content":"I don't know if it counts as hunting down or saving people.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T16:10:52-07:00","id":971559,"title":"","content":"Is there any way for a Brood to hop into someone's Oneiros and <i>coerce</i> someone into reforming themself?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T20:27:47-07:00","id":971717,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/968741-unexpected-beast-inspiration-persona-5?p=971559#post971559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there any way for a Brood to hop into someone's Oneiros and <i>coerce</i> someone into reforming themself?</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, that seems to be the bare-bones version of what Nightmares-as-Social-Maneuvering constitutes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T17:53:53-07:00","id":1143928,"title":"","content":"You could also look at the Palaces as great inspiration for more modern looking lairs even.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","name":"Mangaholic13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-11T19:07:13-07:00","id":1148960,"title":"","content":"This little meme wormed its way into my mind a while back. It's not a perfect one-for-one, but yeah, the Phantom Thieves are a group of Nemeses who prefer going after other Beasts (that's how I interpret the Targets' Personas).<br /> <br /> Kamoshida is such a dark starter villain, the game does feel like a CoD Chronicle at times. Namtaru (seriously, <a href=\"https://cdn.vox-cdn.com/uploads/chorus_asset/file/8560919/Kamoshida_s_Castle_Screenshot_2017_05_21_21_18_00.png\" target=\"_blank\">look at this thing</a>- possible NSFW with the female forms in the trophy- and tell me it's not a Namtaru) Tyrant (imagines himself as the &quot;king&quot; of the school, and the students are his to use and abuse in any way he sees fit).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T01:33:07-08:00","id":1193844,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Haberdasher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/968741-unexpected-beast-inspiration-persona-5?p=1148960#post1148960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This little meme wormed its way into my mind a while back. It's not a perfect one-for-one, but yeah, the Phantom Thieves are a group of Nemeses who prefer going after other Beasts (that's how I interpret the Targets' Personas).<br /> <br /> Kamoshida is such a dark starter villain, the game does feel like a CoD Chronicle at times. Namtaru (seriously, <a href=\"https://cdn.vox-cdn.com/uploads/chorus_asset/file/8560919/Kamoshida_s_Castle_Screenshot_2017_05_21_21_18_00.png\" target=\"_blank\">look at this thing</a>- possible NSFW with the female forms in the trophy- and tell me it's not a Namtaru) Tyrant (imagines himself as the &quot;king&quot; of the school, and the students are his to use and abuse in any way he sees fit).</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bNot only that, but it's rather revolting how he abuses his authority in order to have his way.<br /> <br /> \u200bMadarame meanwhile would be a Inguma (Given the garishness of his Shadow, the uncanny valley nature of his boss form, and how he pulls off maintaining a fa\u00e7ade of humility) Collector (He steals the works of others and presents them as his own).<br /> <br /> \u200bKaneshiro is a Anakim (given the way he leaves his victims feeling powerless and destitute, as well as the way he tries to crush you during his boss fight) Enabler/Whisper (since he uses his victims' own actions/secrets to bleed them dry).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":17107,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","user":"Mangaholic13","date":". 03-10-2018, 04:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","name":"Mangaholic13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T06:00:39-08:00","id":1193892,"title":"","content":"I wonder what Family the Phantom Thieves themselves count as. Would Inguma fit for any of them? (Not sure, not having picked up the book yet)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T11:46:52-08:00","id":1193993,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/968741-unexpected-beast-inspiration-persona-5?p=1193892#post1193892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder what Family the Phantom Thieves themselves count as. Would Inguma fit for any of them? (Not sure, not having picked up the book yet)</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bEither that or Eshmaki, Anakim, or Ugallu. It would probably vary from thief to thief.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","name":"Mangaholic13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T13:04:16-08:00","id":1194015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/968741-unexpected-beast-inspiration-persona-5?p=1193892#post1193892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder what Family the Phantom Thieves themselves count as. Would Inguma fit for any of them? (Not sure, not having picked up the book yet)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ahem:<br /> <br /> <b>Ren/Akira: </b>Inguma Nemesis, whose Hunger is largely for punishment of people who believe themselves kings. He enjoys the taste of realizing that your social net is no longer working.<br /> <br /> <b>Ryuji: </b>Anakim Ravager, here to remind you that no Bastard King rules forever. <br /> <br /> <b>Ann</b>: Eshmaki Predator, who really, really does not like herd animals who pray on herd animals.<br /> <br /> <b>Morgana: </b>Some weird Dreamborn who's Kin to the brood, Claimed a cat a while ago and now has Virtue/Vice.<br /> <br /> <b>Yusuke: </b>Ugallu Collector, gathering inspiration at the tip of a talon.<br /> <br /> <b>Makoto</b>: Talasii Tyrant, who proves that no one is above the Law, and she is the Law.<br /> <br /> <b>Futaba:</b> Inguma Whisper, as I am not very creative. Was harassed by a Ugallu Nemesis Unfettered for a while.<br /> <br /> <b>Haru: </b>Anakim Tyrant, for she is not the one bound.<br /> <br /> <b>Akechi:</b> Inguma Enabler who is proof that sometimes, they end up being the one trapped by sin.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T14:12:26-08:00","id":1194037,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/968741-unexpected-beast-inspiration-persona-5?p=1194015#post1194015\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Morgana: </b>Some weird Dreamborn who's Kin to the brood, Claimed a cat a while ago and now has Virtue/Vice.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bConsidering the way he reacts to treasure and is the infiltration expert, I'd say he's closer to an Eshmaki Collector, personally.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Makoto</b>: Talasii Tyrant, who proves that no one is above the Law, and she is the Law. </div> </div> </div>\u200bI AM THE LAW!!!<br /> \u200b... Sorry, I couldn't resist...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","name":"Mangaholic13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}